  "title": "Thanksgiving Bread Pudding",
  "description": "For Thanksgiving, bread pudding with a sweet rum sauce is a nice alternative to pumpkin pie, but why not make both since everyone looks forward to the holiday dessert table?",
  "authors": [
    "DAWNMARIEF"
  ],
  "date_published": "2011-01-16T00:38:34-05:00",
